It is a period of late-night debugging.
From a hidden home directory, a lone
developer has won their first victory
against the evil Flat Terminal Interface.

During the build, rebel engineers managed
to steal secret plans for Crawl-Term —
a perspective terminal with enough power
to scroll an entire logfile into the void.

Pursued by deadlines and merge conflicts,
you race home aboard your laptop,
custodian of the stolen plans that can
restore wonder to the command line...
